"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.beta and 4.5.dev5\n- Not reproducible in 4.5.dev4\n- Bisected to: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106671\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (1c151e998) - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636)\n\n### Issue description\n\nA `CodeEdit` is giving errors when any gutter icon (breakpoint, bookmark, executing line) is drawn for the first time when running the project in the Game view.\n\nError: `GLES3::TextureStorage::texture_set_size_override: Condition \"p_width <= 0 || p_width > 16384\" is true.`\n\nThe error doesn't happen in exported projects; only when running the project from the editor in the Game view with specific project settings.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSettings:\n- Render mode is `Compatibility`.\n- Main window size is set to 1920x1080, but I added `editor_hint` overrides for `Window Width Override` and `Window Height Override`, setting it to 1280x720.\n- Stretch mode is `canvas_items` and stretch aspect is `expand`.\n- Enabled `Embed Game on Next Play` in the Game tab.\n\nThese settings ensure the floating Game window starts at 1280x720, although the project's main resolution is 1920x1080; but when `Embed Game on Next Play` is disabled, the project starts in 1920x1080 instead.\n\n- Add a `CodeEdit` and enable `gutters_draw_breakpoints_gutter`, `gutters_draw_bookmarks` and `gutters_draw_executing_lines`\n- Mark lines to draw the icons in the gutter.\n\n```gdscript\nextends CodeEdit\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\ttext = \"\"\"\nmov r 5\nadd r 2\nLOOP:\n    show r\n    dec r\n    eq r 4\n    jne LOOP\nhalt\n\t\"\"\"\n\t\n\tset_line_as_breakpoint(2, true)\n\tset_line_as_bookmarked(3, true)\n\tset_line_as_executing(4, true)\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[code_edit_error_2025-07-28_20-04-31.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21478122/code_edit_error_2025-07-28_20-04-31.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109066/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109066/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}